, and fully immersive environment to build confidence and sharpen counseling techniques.\nEvery conversation is truly dynamic.", "short_description": "Generate fully custom client cases, including the client\u2019s type of help request, age, gender, appearance, voice, and any language. Interact naturally, and build experience in a safe, immersive environment to train with your AI client. Evrience Fire brings therapy education to life."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://evrience.com/evrience-fire-privacy-policy", "developer_terms_of_service_url": "https://evrience.com/evrience-fire-terms-of-service/", "publisher_name": "Evrience", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://evrience.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1043107547362485"}, {"id": "514087707868786"}], "external_subscription_type": "REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "SITTING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "24551118227880159"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1384291042703939"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1384291042703939"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1757419680, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1384291042703939"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "25968706182788016", "version": "1.0.152"}, "id": "1180977653815257", "channel_name": "LIVE"}]}, "is_for_oculus_keys_only": false, "primary_bi